      "held_source": "First cubic Bezier segment of the path in kit/logos/yolea-mark.svg: M44 84 C44 66 45 56 40 48, i.e. P0 (44,84), P1 (44,66), P2 (45,56), P3 (40,48) in the 96 grid. Frame: origin at P0, progress axis y with P3 at 1 (progress = (84 - y) / 36), lateral axis x measured as the unsigned distance from P0 (|x - 44| / |40 - 44|), so the control points become P1 = (0/4, 18/36) and P2 = (1/4, 28/36); rounded to two decimals this is cubic-bezier(0, 0.5, 0.25, 0.78). Published again as <path id=\"ease-held\"> in kit/marks/fil.svg.",
